    "result_text": "The full suite is green \u2014 **61 tests, 0 failures, 0 errors**.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `selfLink` field on the owner resource so that `GET /api/owners/{id}` returns `selfLink = \"/api/owners/\" + id`.\n\nTwo changes, following the existing derived-field pattern in this codebase:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `selfLink` string property to the `Owner` schema (the DTO is code-generated from this spec at build time).\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a `@Mapping(target = \"selfLink\", expression = \"java(selfLink(owner))\")` on `toOwnerDto` plus a `selfLink(Owner)` default method that returns `\"/api/owners/\" + owner.getId()` (null-guarded on id, consistent with the other derived fields).\n\nSince `toOwnerDto` is used by both the create (`addOwner`) and read (`getOwner`) paths, the self link is populated wherever an owner is serialized. The new `Cp49Tests` passes and no existing test regressed.",
